      "writtenOn": "2020-07-27T22:53:19Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The \"false alarm\" means the debounced_power_pressed won\u0027t change. It is like:\n (1) power button previously released\n (2) interrupt (which set power_button_is_stable to 0)\n (3) enter the loop\n (4) after debounce, still released (false alarm), and set power_button_is_stable to 1\n\nIt makes the loop forever wait. The power button is already released; it won\u0027t trigger another release event any more.",
      "parentUuid": "42e16e27_b599ff32",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 14,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 18,
        "endChar": 64
      },
      "revId": "b105b1117211cb7faff9328114015d0d269953ba",
